<title>TURKMENISTAN: Turkmen industry output 24.9 pct down in Jan-Apr.</title>
<headline>Turkmen industry output 24.9 pct down in Jan-Apr.</headline>
<dateline>ASHGABAT 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkmenistan's industrial output plunged 24.9 percent in January-April compared to the same period last year, a report from the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    TURKMEN INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION    Jan-Apr '97     Jan-Apr '96</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change		-24.9	     +31.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
